# covers: 8 Array initialization
# covers: 8 Collection iteration
# covers: 1 Constants
# covers: 2 Structures / Records
# covers: 16 Global initialization
# kind: positive
# expect: run
# exit: 0
# stdout: 3
# stdout: 60

prices is module
prices purpose "Sum the prices in a constant table of records"
prices path prices
prices imports standard.console
prices imports standard.math
prices exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParameter none
showInt input value Int64 copied
showInt output none
showInt outputOwnedBy none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memoryHeap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt let none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue argument value Int64 value copy
writeValue result none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError
writeValue suppresses console.WriteError.failed

Item is record
Item purpose "One priced item"
Item typeParameter none
Item field code Int64
Item field price Int64

catalog is table
catalog purpose "Every item for sale, in a fixed order"
catalog rowType Item
catalog row apple 1
catalog row bread 2
catalog row cheese 3
catalog cell apple code 1
catalog cell apple price 10
catalog cell bread code 2
catalog cell bread price 20
catalog cell cheese code 3
catalog cell cheese price 30

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap false
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label sumPrices loopKind forEach
main label sumPrices within none
main label sumPrices maxIterations 3
main label sumPrices over catalog
main label addPrice loopKind none
main label addPrice within sumPrices
main label done loopKind none
main label done within none
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let total Int64 0 mutable
main let count Int64 0 mutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main at begin goto sumPrices
main at sumPrices branch ifNext catalog bind item Item goto addPrice else goto done
main at addPrice do readPrice
main at addPrice do addToTotal
main at addPrice set total newTotal
main at addPrice do countItem
main at addPrice set count newCount
main at addPrice goto sumPrices
main at done do showCount
main at done do showTotal
main at done return ok okCode

readPrice is call
readPrice in main
readPrice invokes Item.price
readPrice argument record Item item copy
readPrice result price Int64
readPrice ownedBy none
readPrice cleanedBy none
readPrice borrows none
readPrice catch none
readPrice suppresses none

addToTotal is call
addToTotal in main
addToTotal invokes math.addInt64
addToTotal argument left Int64 total copy
addToTotal argument right Int64 price copy
addToTotal result newTotal Int64
addToTotal ownedBy none
addToTotal cleanedBy none
addToTotal borrows none
addToTotal catch none
addToTotal suppresses none

countItem is call
countItem in main
countItem invokes math.addInt64
countItem argument left Int64 count copy
countItem argument right Int64 one copy
countItem result newCount Int64
countItem ownedBy none
countItem cleanedBy none
countItem borrows none
countItem catch none
countItem suppresses none

showCount is call
showCount in main
showCount invokes showInt
showCount argument value Int64 count copy
showCount result none
showCount ownedBy none
showCount cleanedBy none
showCount borrows none
showCount catch none
showCount suppresses none

showTotal is call
showTotal in main
showTotal invokes showInt
showTotal argument value Int64 total copy
showTotal result none
showTotal ownedBy none
showTotal cleanedBy none
showTotal borrows none
showTotal catch none
showTotal suppresses none
